  "bio": "Bart is a highly skilled and dedicated tattoo artist based in Wroclaw, Poland, who specializes in fine line and sketch style tattoos. With a unique capacity for transforming bodily canvases, Bart seamlessly blends his passion for tattoos, drawings and memes into each intricate design, leaving clients with stunning, bespoke artwork etched on their skin.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Wroclaw, Lower Silesian Voivodeship, Poland"
